WEBVTT

00:03:59.151 --> 00:04:00.569
So let me set the stage.

00:04:03.239 --> 00:04:08.327
For those of you who haven’t
heard the term before,

00:04:08.327 --> 00:04:09.704
fanfiction,

00:04:09.704 --> 00:04:13.374
sometimes known
as transformative literature,

00:04:13.374 --> 00:04:15.668
is said by some to go back centuries.

00:04:17.169 --> 00:04:20.131
After all, in the 1600s,

00:04:20.131 --> 00:04:24.176
John Milton wrote “Paradise Lost”
using characters from the Bible.

00:04:24.719 --> 00:04:29.348
(Laughter)

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:32.018
